Description: Live video wallpapers — play MP4 loops as your desktop background.
 Paperloom plays looping MP4 videos as your Linux desktop background (Wallpaper
 Engine / Lively Wallpaper, but native to X11/Wayland). GUI-only: import videos
 (or download them from the built-in online library), click "Set as wallpaper",
 done. Designed to idle at near-zero CPU/RAM — the renderer pauses on
 fullscreen apps, screen lock, low battery, or any window covering the desktop
 (each independently configurable).

